[{"i":"8968","no":1,"t":2,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">如图选出下列结构最稳定的两个选项？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-03/8489866761867583488.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"a"},{"l":"B","c":"b"},{"l":"C","c":"c"},{"l":"D","c":"d"}],"a":"A,D","an":"","sc":4.0,"kp":["稳定结构和不稳定结构的特性","基本结构认知"]},{"i":"8969","no":2,"t":2,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">下列能增加模型稳定性的做法是？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>多采用三角形结构</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>多采用四边形结构</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>增大模型与地面的接触面积</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>减小模型与地面的接触面积</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"}],"a":"A,C","an":"<p>分析结构的几何特性对稳定性的影响，考虑不同形状在受力时的形变趋势；探讨支撑面大小与重心位置关系对整体抗倾覆能力的作用机制。</p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["稳定结构和不稳定结构的特性","基本结构认知"]},{"i":"8970","no":3,"t":2,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">关于荡秋千说法正确的是？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>秋千在最低点时动能最大</span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>秋千在最低点时速度最大</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">秋千在最高点时速度为</font><font face=\"Calibri\">0</font></span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>秋千在最高点时势能最大</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"}],"a":"A,B,C,D","an":"<p>分析物体在周期性摆动过程中的能量转换与运动状态。当物体从高处向低处运动时，势能转化为动能，速度逐渐增加；到达最低位置时，高度最低，势能最小，动能达到最大值，速度也达到峰值。当物体由低处向高处运动时，动能转化为势能，速度减小；到达最高位置时，高度最高，势能最大，瞬时速度为零。整个过程中机械能守恒，忽略空气阻力和摩擦损耗，动能与势能相互转化，速度随位置变化呈现周期性特征。</p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["重心和重力的概念"]},{"i":"8971","no":4,"t":2,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">下列能增加物体稳定性的是？（</font> <font face=\"宋体\">）</font></span></p>","o":[{"l":"A","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>降低物体的重心</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p>"},{"l":"B","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>升高物体的重心</span></p>"},{"l":"C","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>物体的重心向地面做垂线，交点落在接触面以内</span></p>"},{"l":"D","c":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>物体的重心向地面做垂线，交点落在接触面以外</span></p>"}],"a":"A,C","an":"<p>分析物体稳定性时，需考虑重心位置与支撑面的关系。降低重心可减小倾覆力矩，提升抗倾覆能力。重心向地面所作垂线的落点决定支撑状态：当落点位于接触面内部时，物体受到扰动后仍存在恢复力矩；若落点超出接触面边界，则无恢复力矩。重心高度与垂线落点共同构成判断稳定性的几何条件。</p>","sc":4.0,"kp":["稳定结构和不稳定结构的特性","重心和重力的概念"]},{"i":"8972","no":5,"t":4,"s":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>搭建说明</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>请考生制作一个秋千模型。</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>搭建要求</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">(a) </font><font face=\"宋体\">具备秋千模型大体框架；</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">(b) </font><font face=\"宋体\">秋千架两侧采用三角形结构增加稳定性；</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">(c) </font><font face=\"宋体\">秋千的绳索部分用长杆表示，有表示座椅的部件；</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span><font face=\"Calibri\">(d) </font><font face=\"宋体\">给座椅一个力，它能流畅地来回摆动。</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>器材说明</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>考生作答时不指定任何器材，所搭建的模型在外形、结构、功能方面满足题目要求即可。以下样例模型选自经中国电子学会评审通过的青少年机器人技术等级考试一级、二级适用器材。仅供参考，不作为考试评分的唯一依据。</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>案例样图</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>以下列举了相关器材模型样例，考生可任选其一作为参考。</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\">1</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-03/8489866761943080960.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\">2</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-03/8489866762031161344.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\">3</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"justify\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-03/8489866762119241728.png\" alt=\"undefined\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\">4</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-03/8489866762211516416.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\">5</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-03/8489866762307985408.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span><font face=\"宋体\">样例</font><font face=\"Calibri\">6</font></span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><img src=\"https://minio.liankexue.cn/npsc-common-bucket/default/2024-06-14-16-03-03/8489866762396065793.png\" alt=\"undefined\"><br></p>","o":[],"a":"<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>评分</span></b><b><span>说明</span></b><b><span><o:p></o:p></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>1、</span></b><b><span><font face=\"宋体\">整体框架（</font>40分）</span></b><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>(</span><span>1)作品零件结构是否和样例模型基本一致、结构完整</span><span><font face=\"宋体\">，具备</font><font face=\"宋体\">①两侧</font></span><span>三角形框架</span><span><font face=\"宋体\">、</font><font face=\"宋体\">②秋千绳索</font></span><span>或长杆</span><span><font face=\"宋体\">、</font><font face=\"宋体\">③表示座椅</font></span><span>的部件</span><span>，以上每缺少一点扣</span><span>10</span><span>分，缺少两点及两点以上扣</span><span>20</span><span>分。（</span><span>20</span><span>分）</span><span><br></span><span>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span>(</span><span>2)作品相应部件的固定可靠程度</span><span>；</span><span><font face=\"宋体\">（</font>10分）</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>(</span><span>3)作品的整体协调性和美观性。（10分）</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>2、</span></b><b><span><font face=\"宋体\">动力传递</font>/表现形式（30分）</span></b><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>(</span><span>1)</span><span>给座椅一个力，它能来回摆动；</span><span><font face=\"宋体\">（</font>15分）</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>(</span><span>2)作品整体动作顺利流畅。（15分）</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span>3、</span></b><b><span><font face=\"宋体\">完成时间（</font>10分）</span></b><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>在考试时间内完成得</span><span>10</span><span>分，超时</span><span>1</span><span>分钟扣</span><span>1</span><span>分。（</span><span>10</span><span>分）</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span>超时</span><span>10</span><span>分钟以上不结束操作总成绩记为</span><span>0</span><span>分。</span><span><o:p></o:p></span></p>","an":"","sc":80.0,"kp":["稳定结构和不稳定结构的特性","基本结构认知","六种简单机械原理（杠杆，轮轴，滑轮，斜面，楔，螺旋）"]}]